{
  "slug": "website-quality-checker",
  "name": "Website Quality Checker",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Webpage quality evaluator based on Google Search Quality Rater Guidelines (QRG). Inspects page purpose, MC quality, E-E-A-T, reputation, and spam signals to produce a graded report (S/A/B/C/D).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `website-quality-checker` (Google Search Quality Rater Guidelines(QRG)를 기반으로 웹페이지의 품질을 검사하는 스킬).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install website-quality-checker@claude-community` from `llqqssttyy/website-quality-checker`.\n\nEnglish | 한국어\n\nWebpage quality evaluator based on Google Search Quality Rater Guidelines (QRG). Inspects page purpose, MC quality, E-E-A-T, reputation, and spam signals to produce a graded report (S/A/B/C/D).",
